     * <p>This method returns {@link #INDEX_NOT_FOUND} (<code>-1</code>) for a <code>null</code> input array.</p>
     *
     * <p>A negative startIndex will return {@link #INDEX_NOT_FOUND} (<code>-1</code>). A startIndex larger than
